        "name": "WEIGHT CONVERSION",
        "func": "// Convert dashboard input to a float number\nlet weight = parseFloat(msg.payload);\n\n// Allocate a 4-byte buffer for a 32-bit IEEE 754 REAL\nlet buf = Buffer.alloc(4);\nbuf.writeFloatBE(weight, 0); // Big-Endian format matching OpenPLC\n\n// Output as two 16-bit unsigned integers for FC 16\nmsg.payload = [\n    buf.readUInt16BE(0), // High word (Registers 40001 / %MD0)\n    buf.readUInt16BE(2)  // Low word  (Registers 40002)\n];\n\nreturn msg;",
